<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 8,756 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 116.53 pence a kilo against 125.80 last week and 111.48 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 232,238 pkgs sold so far this year is 112.87 pence against 101.22 pence for the 335,528 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
